		<item>
			<title>Madonna's World Tour 2012</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-world-tour-2012.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-world-tour-2012.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>The first news we have got about <strong>Madonna's next world tour</strong> are included in the details of <strong>Madonna</strong>'s collaboration with <strong>Smirnoff Nightlife Project</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>The tour is planned for <strong>2012</strong> with rehearsals expected to start in the first quarter of <strong>2012</strong>, probably in March. Dancers must have at least twelve months validity on their passport from March 2012.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Countries/continents which may be included in <strong>Madonna world tour 2012</strong> are <strong>USA</strong>, <strong>South America</strong>, <strong>Canada</strong>, <strong>Europe</strong>, <strong>Australia</strong> and <strong>New Zealand</strong>.</p>
<div class="catItemIntroText">
<p> </p>
</div>
<ul>
<li>UPDATE (7 October, 2011): According to always accurate and reliable Italian newspaper <strong>La  Repubblica</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> will perform in  <strong>Milan</strong> on <strong>June 14, 2012</strong>. Reportedly, the concert is taking   place at <strong>Milan's San Siro Stadium</strong>. The stadium has been  already booked.</li>
<li>UPDATE (9 November, 2011): <a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/220-madonna-tour-2012-official-european-dates-revealed.html" target="_self">Click here</a> to read the first <strong>European dates</strong> that are confirmed at the moment. The concert in <strong>Milan</strong> on June 14 is one of them.</li>
<li>UPDATE (12 November, 2011): Dancer <strong>Lil' Buck</strong> is the winner of the <strong>Dance4Madonna</strong> contest in collaboration with <strong>Smirnoff</strong>., which took place at Roseland Ballroom in New York City on November 12. He will be touring with <strong>Madonna</strong>.</li>
<li>UPDATE (22 November, 2011): DrownedMadonna.com heard that <strong>Madonna</strong> will launch her new tour in <strong>Tel Aviv</strong>, <strong>Israel</strong>, on <strong>May 31th</strong>, 2012. <a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/263-madonna-to-launch-her-2012-tour-in-israel.html" target="_self">Read more</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
<p><a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/dance-auditions-for-madonna-next-tour-in-collaboration-with-smirnoff.html" target="_self" title="Dance auditions for Madonna World Tour 2012">Click here</a> and read details on dance auditions.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><em>Always come back and check this page for latest info.</em></p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>Rich & Tone Talauega</li><li>Tour</li><ul></div>]]></description>
