		<item>
			<title>More details on the Dancers Auditions in New York City for Madonna's New Tour</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/52-more-details-on-the-dancers-auditions-in-new-york-city-for-madonnas-new-tour.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/52-more-details-on-the-dancers-auditions-in-new-york-city-for-madonnas-new-tour.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Smirnoff</strong> just gave us more details regarding the dancers auditions on <strong>September 8</strong> in <strong>New York City</strong> for <strong>Madonna's new tour</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>This casting call is for <strong>New York</strong> and <strong>Connecticut</strong> residents only.</p>
<p>One dancer from this audition will be chosen by <strong>Madonna</strong>'s choreographers <strong>Rich and Tone Talauega</strong> to attend the <strong>November 12</strong> dance event. The <strong>Smirnoff - Madonna Nightlife Exchange</strong> final event will take place in <strong>New York</strong> as well.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Come dressed to dance. You must not wear clothing with visible logos/brands. Please bring proper identification showing current address. All auditons may be filmed for use in future promotional content.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><img src="http://drownedmadonna.com/img/2011/madonna-tour-dancer-auditions-nyc.jpg" border="0" alt="Madonna tour dancers auditions NYC" width="790" height="602" style="border: 0;" /></p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>Smirnoff</li><li>Rich & Tone Talauega</li><ul></div>]]></description>
			<category>Tours</category>
			<pubDate>Wed, 07 Sep 2011 13:36:04 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Dancers auditions for Madonna's New Tour in New York City on September 8 2011</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/50-dancers-auditions-for-madonnas-new-tour-in-new-york-city-on-september-8-2011.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/50-dancers-auditions-for-madonnas-new-tour-in-new-york-city-on-september-8-2011.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><a href="http://perezhilton.com/2011-09-06-madonna-live-casting-call-dancers-dance-new-york-city-tour" target="_blank" title="Perez Hilton Madonna dancers auditions">Perez Hilton</a> has got cool news! There will be a live casting call in <strong>New York City</strong> for <strong>dancers</strong> who wish to join <strong>Madonna</strong> on her <strong>next tour</strong>.The casting will take place at <strong>Broadway Dance Center</strong> on <strong>Septeber 8 2011</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> long-time choreographers <strong>Rich &amp; Tone Talauega</strong> will judge the auditioners.</p>
<p>It should be part of the <strong>Smirnoff Nightlife Exchange project</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Here are the details:</p>
<p> </p>
<p>LIVE CASTING CALL, 21+<br /> BROADWAY DANCE CENTER<br /> SEPTEMBER 8 2011<br /> DOORS OPEN AT 7AM<br /> AUDITIONS FROM 8 AM TO 1 PM<br /> MADONNA'S CELEBRITY CHOREOGRAPHERS <strong>RICH</strong> &amp; <strong>TONE</strong> WILL JUDGE YOUR AUDITION!</p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>New Album</li><li>U.S.A.</li><li>Dancers Auditions</li><li>Rich & Tone Talauega</li><ul></div>]]></description>
